    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8343" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνεπαχθής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>not burdensome, without
				offence,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Cat.Mi.</u>
				8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Pomp.</u>
				1
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκώμματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Ep.Sat.</u>
					34
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-θῶς, προσομιλεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					2.37
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λέγειν</span>”
