					Plu.
					2.102e
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>without discomfort,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Or.</u>
				6.191d
			</span></i>.</div>
